OL,3,GNEWSAFour people rescued as sailing
OL,4,Aboat sinks off coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been rescued from a
OL,7,Fsinking sailing boat.
OL,9,FThe alarm was raised at 03:35 BST on
OL,10,FSunday when a 36-foot (11m) sailing
OL,11,Fboat ran aground on Long Sand, 18 miles
OL,12,F(29km) east of Clacton-on-Sea on the
OL,13,FEssex coast.
OL,15,FThe vessel began sinking rapidly and
OL,16,Ffour crew members were evacuated but
OL,17,Fthe boat was lost, the RNLI said.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
