OL,3,GNEWSAFour people rescued as sailing
OL,4,Aboat sinks off coast
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The coxswain with the support of his
OL,7,Fcrew did an exceptional job in saving
OL,8,Ffour lives and, thanks to the lifeboat
OL,9,Fcrew, four men will be going home to
OL,10,Ftheir families," said lifeboat
OL,11,Foperations manager Carlo Bardetti.
